Package: ShinyFruit
Title: A Shiny app for analyzing images of fruits and vegetables
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Mason",
           family = "Chizk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mchizk@abacusbio.com")
Description: This package allows the user to run a Shiny app locally.  This app is capable of loading in jpg formatted images and analyzing size, shape, counts, and color attributes of fruits and vegetables.
